            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Atmo 1.5.0</h2>
<p>Atmo 1.5 refreshes the Settings window with a cleaner, native layout.</p>

<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Redesigned Settings</b> — settings are now organized into General, Devices, Pairing &amp; Network, and Updates sections using the modern macOS grouped style</li>
</ul>

<p>Requires macOS 13 or later.</p>
