            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Atmo 1.4.0</h2>
<p>Atmo 1.4 adds built-in automatic updates, so this is the last release you need to download by hand.</p>

<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Automatic updates</b> — Atmo now keeps itself up to date via Sparkle. On first launch you'll be asked whether to check for updates automatically; you can change this any time in Settings → Updates</li>
  <li><b>Check for Updates…</b> — check on demand from the Atmo menu</li>
</ul>

<p>Requires macOS 13 or later.</p>
]]></description>
